{"id":"se_","lemma":"sé","pos":"pron","rank":1527,"glosses":["oneself, himself, herself"],"ipa":"/ˈse/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-s%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ha pochi soldi con sé.","en":"He has little money with him.","words":[{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Sembrava sicuro di sé.","en":"He seemed sure of himself.","words":[{"g":"to seem","l":"sembrare"},{"g":"safe"},{"g":"of"},null]},{"text":"Guardi davanti a sé, per piacere.","en":"Look forward, please.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"guardare"},null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"in front of"],[4,6,"please"]]},{"text":"Porti il suo telefono con sé.","en":"Take your phone with you.","words":[{"g":"port, harbour/harbor","l":"porto"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"his, hers, its"},{"g":"telephone, phone"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Ha tenuto per sé il segreto.","en":"He had kept the secret to himself.","words":[{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"obliged"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"secret"}]}]}